  "label": "Dark humor",
  "description": "A form of humor that derives its effect from subjects that are taboo, morbid, or tragic. The meme uses dark humor to trivialize the 9/11 victims by comparing their deaths to a 'reading speed', which is a grotesque and insensitive joke. This concept is necessary to understand the meme's intent and its harmful nature.",
